00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:34.000
putting it on and I got bored so I only
left it on for seven minutes instead of

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.500
10 to 15 if you want the full cloud
experience you should do both of these

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:49.360
things so what exactly is the point of
having oxygen in these products one of

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:53.739
the reasons is because the amount of
oxygen in your skin decreases as you get

00:03:53.739 --> 00:03:58.569
older it also decreases if you smoke or
if you get a lot of UV exposure from the

00:03:58.569 --> 00:04:02.530
Sun it's estimated that there's a
quarter less oxygen in your skin by the

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:07.000
time you're 30 and only half of it
remains by the time you're 40 you need

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.349
oxygen in your skin to produce collagen
so it's possible that if you don't have

00:04:11.349 --> 00:04:15.280
enough oxygen then your collagen levels
will drop and you'll end up with thinner

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.820
saggy
duller skin and wrinkles there's been

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.419
some research that found that extra
oxygen can help with wound healing and

00:04:22.419 --> 00:04:26.440
it increases something called filaggrin
this is a protein in your skin

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:30.070
that's important for keeping a healthy
skin barrier oxygen could also

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:34.150
potentially help kill acne bacteria
there was an animal study as well which

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:38.229
found that oxygen reduced wrinkles
caused by UV the problem with oxygen is

00:04:38.229 --> 00:04:42.370
that there haven't been any convincing
studies done on humans about how it can

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:45.940
help your skin there's also a potential
side effect which is that the extra

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:51.160
oxygen could increase the amount of
reactive oxygen species or ROS in your

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:56.560
skin these oxidants are important for
lots of biological processes but if you

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:01.270
have too many they can attack and damage
the proteins and DNA in your skin and

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:05.770
this leads to premature aging I've
talked about oxidative stress before in

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:10.180
my video on antioxidants and skincare a
few wound healing studies have looked at

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:17.910
whether this side effect is significant
and they found out it wasn't

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:23.139
so now that we know that oxygen can be
good for your skin the question is is

00:05:23.139 --> 00:05:27.370
there really enough in these products
that can get into your skin to make a

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:32.050
difference there are a few studies on
using oxygenated perfluorocarbons for

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:36.610
wound healing and there's also been one
very basic one on whether or not it can

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:40.750
reduce wrinkles but these studies were
all done using topical gels which are

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:44.979
things that you leave on your skin not
using wash off products like these masks

00:05:44.979 --> 00:05:49.300
so in these studies there was probably
more oxygen getting into the skin most

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:54.220
studies that have been done on oxygen
and wound healing used other methods for

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.789
getting oxygen into the skin like oxygen
producing bandages rather than

00:05:57.789 --> 00:06:01.569
perfluorocarbons the fact that you see
all these bubbles coming up when you use

00:06:01.569 --> 00:06:06.280
an oxygen mask could mean that most of
the oxygen is going into the air and not

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:10.030
into your skin so in other words they're
not really getting to where they can

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:14.080
make a difference but the tickling
feeling does make it feel like it's doing

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:18.009
more the bubbling action could also
potentially loosen dirt so the product

00:06:18.009 --> 00:06:21.550
can get deeper into your pore and then
the bubbles can help unclog it sort of

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:26.860
like how baking soda can unclog a drain
so I think overall until there's be more

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.849
studies done on these oxygen masks
they're mostly just a fun product that

00:06:30.849 --> 00:06:34.690
might help you clean your face better
but I think they're unlikely to have any

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:38.380
anti-aging benefits
